# Paths the diff-changes workflow leaves out of every ci/test/<module> tree before flate renders it
# (patterns are relative to that tree). Only the module's own Flux Kustomizations belong in the diff;
# see the "Sequential Test Fixtures" section of TESTING.md.

# Applied by chainsaw, not Flux, and re-declares objects the module renders itself (its Namespace).
# flate reads the two declarations as two clusters and refuses with "conflicting entry coordinates".
pre-requisites/

# Several files sharing one Flux Kustomization name. flate keeps the last one read and drops the
# rest without an error.
test-resources/
